{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05398","headline":"题汉州西湖 · 房琯","name":"题汉州西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高流缠峻隅，城下缅丘墟。\n决渠信浩荡，潭岛成江湖。\n结宇依回渚，水中信可居。\n三伏气不蒸，四达暑自徂。\n同人千里驾，邻国五马车。\n月出共登舟，风生随所如。\n举麾指极浦，欲极更盘纡。\n缭绕各殊致，夜尽情有余。\n遭乱意不开，即理还暂祛。\n安得长晤语，使我忧更除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房琯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}